    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was close...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's too many of them! Why are there infected creatures down here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All these years and you still haven't broken that habit of asking pointless questions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "None of these pests should be allowed to go any further. I can't imagine what would happen to the village if they broke free.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's more coming! On your right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
