        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Gah, my blade! Curses, it's becoming even more dull from the sheer numbers we're dealing with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to stop them from coming... If I'm not wrong, there are still some pretty powerful Originium bombs in my bag from our last mission; they can be remotely detonated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just gotta think of a way to trigger one without blowing up us too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That ventilation shaft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "It opens up into the inner walls of the cave, so we can use a bomb to blow open the covering and give us an escape route.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "After we're out, we can then quickly detonate the bombs below and cause a cave-in to trap them in... It's definitely feasible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the explosion will also weaken the cave's structure, so we'll have limited time to escape. We'll have to be fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go plant the explosives, but I'll need someone to block the infected creatures, can you handle that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why even ask? I'll hold them off, go set them up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, I'm right here! Don't even think of looking anywhere else!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
