    },
    {
        "text": "My body\u2014I'm fine! That was perfect!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Corne... You should think about going on a diet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Guess I'll ask Hibiscus for ideas when we get back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So are we in the forest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekoinjured"
    },
    {
        "text": "Smithy, over here! The two long-horned people meownaged to escape!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy02"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mew escaped!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you guys always just pop up out of nowhere?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Those chunks of meat were deliberately placed to lure something out from the cave, and we were almost certainly the targets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we managed to escape, so their plan should have failed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Could it have been the villager who gave us the cave's location?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter who did it. We managed to at least block the cave entrance for now, so it's going to be difficult for the headman to make any further moves against us, and I doubt he intends to destroy his own village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the source of Oripathy and the Rathalos are both connected to the cave, then the most direct solution would be to... find out where the cave goes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on its trajectory, it probably ends somewhere within this mountain range, but the exact location will be hard to determine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What if we looked for the Rathalos instead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cave's condition... implies it's been in there before, at the very least, and it might even be at the endpoint you're talking about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1",
        "name2": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, that's very likely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering that returning to the village will only put us in a sticky situation, there's only one path left for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "text": "We head deeper into the forest to find the Rathalos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait just a meowment!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mew just went through a thrilling crisis, and are about to embark on an exciting journey chasing a Rathalos. A Felyne's life truly never pawses!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So furst! We have to fill up our stomachs! Come enjoy the uniqueness of Felyne cuisine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ain't these just leftovers?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mew know nothing, the taste has changed not one bit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_500_noirc_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine... I'm craving some meat, so give me a piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Me too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_752_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy01"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ecological Research team! Onward!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Scholar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_751_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_nekohappy02"
    },
    {
        "text": "New meowterials! Furward!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Felyne Artisan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(chewing)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_502_Yato_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Rathalos... will have to wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
