        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ritou, give me one good reason why you led them to the cave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's simple. Didn't they tell you they were going to deal with that monster? I simply created the perfect conditions for them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you understand what would happen if outsiders found out about our secret?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, of course. Even your niece who only comes back once in a blue moon made such a ruckus when she found out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "If a company familiar with Originium like Rhodes Island found out, the consequences would be unthinkable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So are you ready to handle said consequences?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They will die down there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Think about it carefully, Headman. We're both former hunters. I've laid out the bait, and as we both know, beasts are most tempted by the scent of blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "They'll encounter that monster long before they discover our secret and\u2014 Bam! The battle begins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they're weak, the monster will take care of them for us, and we won't have to worry about any consequences.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if by some chance they <i>can</i> take care of the monster, then wouldn't that also be a win for us? Threat successfully eliminated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "I had some people wait for them to enter, and follow after a short while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surely they'll be weak and injured after fighting the monster, so if we want to dispose of them, that would be our best opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how it ends up, we benefit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You have clearly put a lot of thought into this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And of course, whichever way it goes... it'll be better than you sealing the cave off and stubbornly concealing everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't look so serious. I knew you might be concerned about it, so I just helped you out a little, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, Akira is no longer with us, so I'm your right-hand man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman, it's a disaster! Someone blew up the cave at the back of the village!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "The entrance... has been blocked off by rubble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand, bring some men with you to clean up the debris and re-open the cave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can go now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ritou, was this also part of your brilliant plan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? This was indeed outside my calculations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "But since the cave was blown up, I can't imagine they survived the aftermath, so they probably died along with the monster. No matter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What you've done today...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will weigh the pros and cons for the village and decide whether to hold you accountable for your actions later.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "However, for now I'll send a search party to make sure they stay silent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Works out nicely then, doesn't it? Well, I'll be heading back. There are still quite a few bills I need to go through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "See yourself out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "Akira, you were right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
